[Script Info]ScriptType: v4.00+PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesWrapStyle: 0YCbCr Matrix: TV.709Title: Default Aegisub file[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,115,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0.8,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Captions-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Secondary-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,60,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1.5,0,1,3.8,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 10,0:01:54.01,0:01:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.57,0:01:57.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone! Get up!Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.72,0:02:01.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Did the pirates do this?Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.44,0:02:04.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's still a bunch of people inside!Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.65,0:02:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Iceburg-san?! What's going on upstairs?!Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.94,0:02:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go check!Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.82,0:02:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Pitch in and put out the fire!Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.48,0:02:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fire has started to spread.Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.42,0:02:31.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're a leopard man or whatever... Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.15,0:02:35.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you lay a hand on Iceburg-san!Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.88,0:02:40.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Carnivore zoans are far more ferocious!Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.46,0:02:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. Whether logia, zoan, or paramecia,Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.27,0:02:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all devil fruits have their unique characteristics.Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.43,0:02:54.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the only one that offers pure physical augmentationDialogue: 10,0:02:54.23,0:02:56.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,would be the zoans.Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.73,0:03:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The more we train, the more power we gain.Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.41,0:03:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoans are head and shoulders above the rest in close-quarters combat.Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.58,0:03:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Iceburg-san! – Foremen!Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.80,0:03:12.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci, the shipwrights are coming upstairs.Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.33,0:03:16.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. They won't make it here.Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.47,0:03:18.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.65,0:03:31.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back! The ceiling...Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.33,0:03:42.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie, what're you doing?Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.28,0:03:57.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't no way in hell I'm leavin' you here!Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't! Not with those wounds!Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.99,0:04:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop, Paulie.Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.94,0:04:11.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me... like we're friends!Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.57,0:04:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to be you guys?!Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.59,0:04:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.29,0:04:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all this time...Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.68,0:04:31.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I always thought of you guys as my friends!Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.27,0:04:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The feeling isn't mutual.Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.73,0:04:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dumb pigeon!Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.15,0:04:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.14,0:05:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol.Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.07,0:05:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.14,0:05:30.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have a nice flight off the island!Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.07,0:05:37.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.80,0:05:42.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.20,0:06:01.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.90,0:06:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You too.Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.92,0:06:31.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you get everyone out?!Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.67,0:06:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't go back inside! Have each team account for its men!Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.50,0:06:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Iceburg-san? Did you see him?Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.62,0:06:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's still in there...Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.27,0:06:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's okay!Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.30,0:06:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three foremen were with him; no way they left him behind.Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.39,0:06:49.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys go check over there too!Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This woman...Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.96,0:06:59.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's one of the Straw Hats. I'm sure of it!Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.64,0:07:02.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did she jump out of a window?Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.00,0:07:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She must've narrowly escaped from the blaze.Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.27,0:07:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should we do with her?Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.29,0:07:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously... They caused this mess.Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll make her tell us where the others are!Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.90,0:07:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll round up the rest of them and hand them over to the Navy!Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.91,0:07:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A pirate's testimony will never pass as evidence.Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.11,0:07:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This incident will fade into obscurity.Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.39,0:07:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san...Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.92,0:07:35.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You may be a renowned shipwright and the mayor of a great city...Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.14,0:07:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you, a mere citizen, could never defy our glorious World Government.Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.94,0:07:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go. We'll find Tom's other disciple Franky—Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.98,0:07:58.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,rather, Cutty Flam, and take the blueprints from him.Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.18,0:08:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! Grandma! It's a huge fire!Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.18,0:08:16.95,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Meow!Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.95,0:08:21.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Galley-La's main office. This is just terrible.Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.09,0:08:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Did somebody set the fire?Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.48,0:08:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know for certain...Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.11,0:08:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but often, a bad feeling turns out to be right.Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.20,0:08:35.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do hope Iceburg's all right.Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.54,0:08:43.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that one little thing can be at the root of so much trouble.Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.09,0:09:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno, you said Franky was at your bar?Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.77,0:09:01.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.19,0:09:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he ran off to find Straw Hat.Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.56,0:09:06.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose he'd make himself easy to find.Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.53,0:09:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talk about being in the wrong place at the wrong time.Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.88,0:09:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look.Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.33,0:09:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.05,0:09:23.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got long nose!Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right, we do!Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't want us to sew him to a tree–Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.65,0:09:30.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiot! How do you not get it yet?Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.35,0:09:33.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's, "If you don't want us to throw him in the sea!"Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.02,0:09:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sew him in–Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.92,0:09:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Throw him!Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.93,0:09:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, do you even listen?!Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.89,0:09:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What matters more is getting the message to Straw Hat, right?Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.28,0:09:43.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, your message doesn't make any sense!Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.39,0:09:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro's gonna beat you up.Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.11,0:09:47.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"If you don't want us to throw him in the sea,Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.59,0:09:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,come to the warehouse under the bridge! From, Franky!"Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.51,0:09:51.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got that?!Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.01,0:09:57.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if he does come, Big Bro's still gonna beat the piss outta him.Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.80,0:10:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who did you say is waiting for whom, and where?Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.84,0:10:06.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Who the hell are you?!Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.60,0:10:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of somethin', so scram!Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.54,0:10:12.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me in three seconds, or you're all dead men.Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.97,0:10:15.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.66,0:10:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy's talking outta his ass.Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.05,0:10:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who we are?Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.13,0:10:27.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is this warehouse under the bridge?Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.21,0:10:30.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky is there, isn't he?Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.00,0:10:34.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What business do you have with Big Bro?Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.67,0:10:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna talk to him, you'll have to go through us first!Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.89,0:10:57.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you and your East Blue friends came all this way just to split up over a ship!Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.28,0:11:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you guys crying?Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.89,0:11:05.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Don't be dumb! We're not crying, dummy!Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.01,0:11:06.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was just so moving that youDialogue: 10,0:11:06.60,0:11:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,stuck it out with your ship even with everything going on!Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.20,0:11:13.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not crying! Nobody here is crying!Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with these people?Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.83,0:11:23.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you gotta realize I'm not friends with those guys anymore, right?Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.49,0:11:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's a little ditty about your hardships!Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.84,0:11:32.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's called, "Falling Out: Northern Wind Chop!"Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.12,0:11:34.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay! Big Bro!Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you making fun of me?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.32,0:11:47.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, is the tea ready yet? I'm thirsty.Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.00,0:11:50.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– All done! Coming right up! – All done! Coming right up!Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.61,0:11:55.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted from crying... Not that I was crying, though.Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.80,0:12:03.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, Bro. It's a little hot.Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.30,0:12:06.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks.Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.35,0:12:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, I get it, bro. You know...Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.63,0:12:13.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch, it's hot!Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just chill out, damn it!Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.71,0:12:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Sorry 'bout that, Big Bro.Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.83,0:12:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a break and have some tea, too?Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.15,0:12:28.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't blame you.Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.96,0:12:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be pretty mad at us for stealing that 200 million belly from you guys...Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.28,0:12:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,especially since it led to such a big fight.Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.08,0:12:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened, happened.Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.19,0:12:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Holding a grudge won't do me any good.Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.51,0:12:47.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'know, you're all right.Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.41,0:12:48.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool.Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.49,0:12:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that 200 million...Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.99,0:12:54.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We spent it all!Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.66,0:12:56.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll knock you flat on your ass.Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.30,0:12:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now... Simmer down there.Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.52,0:13:03.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've shown me how manly you are.Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.26,0:13:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that means I have no room to be upset over how my home and dismantling yard—Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.36,0:13:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,my beloved Franky House— was completely and utterly destroyed!Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.08,0:13:16.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then you guys just had to beat up my boys!Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.70,0:13:19.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, you rotten bastards...!Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.16,0:13:20.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.05,0:13:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're too worked up!Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.24,0:13:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastards!Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.76,0:13:37.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'know, little bro, a lot's happened,Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.06,0:13:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we should let bygones be bygones.Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.99,0:13:43.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's believe in Steven and work something out.Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.70,0:13:45.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean "call it even Steven."Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.44,0:13:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's "call it even Steven," Bro.Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.77,0:13:53.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any plans now that you're on your own?Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.20,0:13:55.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have anywhere to go, right?Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.11,0:13:59.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If not, I can take you in. Come work for me!Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.02,0:14:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've taken a liking to you.Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.89,0:14:05.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget it! I don't wanna dismantle ships.Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.52,0:14:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure, I left my crew, but I'm still a pirate!Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.00,0:14:14.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's one I call, "Pirate's Creed."Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay! Big Bro!Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.49,0:14:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're making fun of me again!Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.00,0:14:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon... I'm just tryin' to help you figure out what to do next!Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business!Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.09,0:14:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, is this the best place to relax right now?Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.60,0:14:32.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A storm surge is coming soon, right?Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.43,0:14:35.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's exactly why...Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.58,0:14:39.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when Aqua Laguna comes, we'll need everyone to pitch in.Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.41,0:14:46.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By midnight, the sea will reach the second floor of most homes.Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.69,0:14:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now, anyone in the Narrows or on the cape wouldn't stand a chance.Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.27,0:14:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave your ship here, and you won't need to worry.Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.72,0:14:58.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh... Thanks. I appreciate it.Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.08,0:14:59.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dummy! Don't be so cold!Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.40,0:15:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be tough to deal with a flood like that every year.Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.64,0:15:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, at this point, everyone's used to this annual evacuation.Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.51,0:15:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The actual problem is how the sea level rises with every year.Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.77,0:15:17.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Narrows visible above the seaDialogue: 10,0:15:17.77,0:15:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,were built on the rooftops of an old town that existed centuries ago.Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.28,0:15:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's said Shipyard Island and the Narrows were once on the same landmass.Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.98,0:15:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But now, so much of the area is underwater that it's called a floating city.Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.79,0:15:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sidewalks became canals.Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Technically, it's not  the water level that's increasing,Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.33,0:15:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but rather, the island's foundation is sinking.Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.30,0:15:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, there won't be many places left to live in town.Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.99,0:15:53.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh... So even the floating wonder city has its own share of troubles.Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if push comes to shove,Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.29,0:16:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can take the sea train and go live somewhere else.Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.27,0:16:04.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can say that... now.Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.42,0:16:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the sea train has only existed for a little over a decade.Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.93,0:16:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before then, it wasn't so simple to just up and travel across the sea.Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.96,0:16:14.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.62,0:16:18.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally, it was rare to see folks travel between islands.Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.82,0:16:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The island existed in isolation... Its residents grew restless.Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.16,0:16:28.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They became preoccupied with the thought that their land might one day sink.Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.69,0:16:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What eased peoples' fears about the futureDialogue: 10,0:16:42.52,0:16:45.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was the sea train, Puffing Tom.Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.57,0:16:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once it arrived, you could travel without a log pose.Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This was some real progress!Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.61,0:16:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to the sea train's creator, a great shipwright named Tom.Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.19,0:17:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He saved this city and its people.Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.22,0:17:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help...Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.39,0:17:27.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll say "hello" to Big Bro for you.Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.96,0:17:40.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have the location.Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go.Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.17,0:18:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.20,0:18:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, little bro...Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.24,0:18:13.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.54,0:18:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cut to the chase.Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.69,0:18:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you gonna do after you fix that ship?Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.23,0:18:21.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.55,0:18:23.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go on adventures with her again,Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.80,0:18:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and someday we'll go back to our home, the East Blue!Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.81,0:18:30.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like we made it around the world,Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.30,0:18:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but this ship has traveled the Grand Line.Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That should be good enough to call it a triumphant return.Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.98,0:18:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll hold my head up and–Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.48,0:18:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope! There's no going backDialogue: 10,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the East Blue.Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.75,0:18:45.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just too far.Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.15,0:18:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro?Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.99,0:18:56.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we brought the ship here,Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.57,0:18:58.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a real good look at her.Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.95,0:19:01.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That ship is at the end of her life.Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.20,0:19:03.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galley-La's assessment is spot-on.Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.90,0:19:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As someone who's in the dismantling business,Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.30,0:19:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suggest scrapping her.Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What...? That's ridiculous!Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.30,0:19:15.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll help you dismantle your ship!Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.33,0:19:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! What're you saying, you jerk?!Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.99,0:19:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.05,0:19:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.56,0:19:24.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.43,0:19:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just a friendly offer to help scrap your ship.Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.66,0:19:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous! I won't let you!Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.95,0:19:35.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Merry... is my ship!Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.61,0:19:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, she ain't! In fact...Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.57,0:19:41.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she's no longer a ship.Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.36,0:19:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.87,0:19:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.37,0:19:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I asked you earlier what you were gonna do after you fixed this ship, didn't I?Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.47,0:19:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you had said you were willing to die at sea, right alongside this ship,Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.89,0:19:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would have let it go.Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.51,0:20:05.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, you said you wanted to sail back to the East Blue,Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.64,0:20:09.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I'm stopping you here and now, little bro.Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.71,0:20:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ship... won't even make it to the next island.Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.35,0:20:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen. Ships are born with the promise to carry you across the seaDialogue: 10,0:20:24.38,0:20:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from one shore to another.Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.67,0:20:32.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, once a ship can no longer carry you to shore...Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.63,0:20:37.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.13,0:20:38.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.80,0:20:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once she can't carry you to shore...Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.05,0:20:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she's no longer a ship!Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.43,0:20:46.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.65,0:20:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.54,0:21:12.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Get away from Merry!Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.59,0:21:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You stubborn idiot!Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.76,0:21:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you won't listen...Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.07,0:21:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then you should at least take a good look at her...Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.65,0:21:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with your own eyes!Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.59,0:24:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Merry.Dialogue: 10,0:24:30.93,0:24:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you right away.Dialogue: 10,0:24:32.93,0:24:35.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you right away... I'll do it...Dialogue: 10,0:24:37.32,0:24:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as many times as you need...Dialogue: 10,0:24:39.40,0:24:43.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you as many times as you need!Dialogue: 10,0:24:44.06,0:24:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As many times as you need!Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.68,0:24:52.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Enough already, long nose!Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.92,0:24:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saw the bottom of the ship, right?!Dialogue: 10,0:24:54.80,0:24:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With a broken keel, the outer panels are misaligned, and the frame is a wreck!Dialogue: 10,0:24:59.73,0:25:03.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In her condition, one good wave would tear her apart!Dialogue: 10,0:25:03.87,0:25:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, a total amateur like you thinks you can–Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.59,0:25:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you moron!Dialogue: 10,0:25:18.05,0:25:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't say another word!Dialogue: 10,0:25:20.75,0:25:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Shut your mouth, or I'll shut it for you, you metal freak!Dialogue: 10,0:25:34.19,0:25:35.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deep...Dialogue: 10,0:25:38.19,0:25:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deep down...Dialogue: 10,0:25:41.55,0:25:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I already knew...Dialogue: 10,0:25:43.86,0:25:46.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What did you say?!Dialogue: 10,0:25:47.46,0:25:48.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deep down...Dialogue: 10,0:25:51.23,0:25:54.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deep down... I already knew.Dialogue: 10,0:25:56.58,0:26:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that Merry is at the end of her life!Dialogue: 10,0:26:06.19,0:26:07.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deep down...Dialogue: 10,0:26:09.21,0:26:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... knew...Dialogue: 10,0:26:13.72,0:26:16.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I heard the assessment,Dialogue: 10,0:26:16.91,0:26:22.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was finally convinced that what I saw back then really happened.Dialogue: 10,0:26:23.12,0:26:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought I was dreaming.Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.84,0:26:30.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought, "What I'm seeing can't be real."Dialogue: 10,0:26:31.73,0:26:36.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On a foggy night... in a forest under the moonlight,Dialogue: 10,0:26:36.84,0:26:39.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard the strikes of a wooden hammer.Dialogue: 10,0:26:40.47,0:26:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It came from the ship, even though no one was supposed to be aboard.Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.04,0:26:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sound was coming from our battered, grounded ship.Dialogue: 10,0:26:53.37,0:26:57.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Despite how thick the fog was, I definitely saw someone there,Dialogue: 10,0:26:57.60,0:27:00.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,using a wooden hammer.Dialogue: 10,0:27:00.10,0:27:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just... couldn't figure out who it was.Dialogue: 10,0:27:06.29,0:27:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But then, when morning came,Dialogue: 10,0:27:09.27,0:27:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,though the work was lousy, the ship was fixed.Dialogue: 10,0:27:13.25,0:27:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The broken mast was also restored to its former shape.Dialogue: 10,0:27:16.07,0:27:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the weirdest part was...Dialogue: 10,0:27:20.74,0:27:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,whoever fixed the Merry knew her original design.Dialogue: 10,0:27:26.71,0:27:29.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Despite how much we had refitted her,Dialogue: 10,0:27:29.73,0:27:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,someone restored the Merry to how she used to look!Dialogue: 10,0:27:36.41,0:27:38.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was something we couldn't answer, but...Dialogue: 10,0:27:38.51,0:27:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for some reason, I remembered these words deep down...Dialogue: 10,0:27:42.90,0:27:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if the person I saw actually said it, or if I was imagining things...Dialogue: 10,0:27:49.42,0:27:50.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 10,0:27:53.51,0:27:56.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll carry you guys for a little bit longer.Dialogue: 10,0:27:58.85,0:28:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know this sounds stupid, but...Dialogue: 10,0:28:01.22,0:28:08.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I feel like it might have been the incarnation of the Merry.Dialogue: 10,0:28:13.33,0:28:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet she was already at her limits back then.Dialogue: 10,0:28:17.80,0:28:23.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She might've assumed that form so she could let us know.Dialogue: 10,0:28:25.57,0:28:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I heard the assessment, that's all I thought about.Dialogue: 10,0:28:33.57,0:28:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think I'm crazy, don't you? You don't have to believe me.Dialogue: 10,0:28:40.45,0:28:41.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro?Dialogue: 10,0:28:42.51,0:28:44.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Believe you?Dialogue: 10,0:28:45.07,0:28:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This person looked like a sailor holding a wooden hammer, right?Dialogue: 10,0:28:50.13,0:28:52.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What...? Why...?Dialogue: 10,0:28:52.22,0:28:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know?Dialogue: 10,0:28:54.91,0:28:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Little bro...Dialogue: 10,0:28:56.63,0:28:59.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saw a klabautermann.Dialogue: 10,0:29:00.11,0:29:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Klabau...?Dialogue: 10,0:29:03.18,0:29:05.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The klabautermann.Dialogue: 10,0:29:05.52,0:29:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a legend known among sailors.Dialogue: 10,0:29:09.23,0:29:14.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a sprite that only lives in ships treated with great care.Dialogue: 10,0:29:14.22,0:29:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose you could say it's a ship's incarnation.Dialogue: 10,0:29:18.47,0:29:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They carry wooden hammers and wear sailor's raincoats.Dialogue: 10,0:29:22.79,0:29:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When danger approaches,Dialogue: 10,0:29:24.47,0:29:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they run around inside the ship to inform the crew about it.Dialogue: 10,0:29:28.04,0:29:32.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's said that they sometimes help sailors quite a bit.Dialogue: 10,0:29:32.42,0:29:36.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But honestly, this is the first time I've heard someone say they saw one.Dialogue: 10,0:29:38.82,0:29:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The more care the ship receives, the more it appreciates its crew.Dialogue: 10,0:29:44.00,0:29:49.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ship must've wanted to make sure you made it to the next island.Dialogue: 10,0:29:49.27,0:29:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She encountered a crew she wanted to carry so badlyDialogue: 10,0:29:54.74,0:29:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that she took the form of a human.Dialogue: 10,0:29:58.41,0:30:01.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet she's been very happy.Dialogue: 10,0:30:06.96,0:30:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merry...Dialogue: 10,0:30:14.08,0:30:15.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 10,0:30:16.21,0:30:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, the one...Dialogue: 10,0:30:18.41,0:30:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who talked to me then...Dialogue: 10,0:30:21.99,0:30:24.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,really was you, huh?Dialogue: 10,0:30:24.59,0:30:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merry...Dialogue: 10,0:30:35.44,0:30:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you've gotta be kidding me...Dialogue: 10,0:30:39.13,0:30:45.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You had a big fight with your friends, knowing your ship was at her limits, then?Dialogue: 10,0:30:47.85,0:30:50.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not that simple.Dialogue: 10,0:30:50.87,0:30:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Men are so inept!Dialogue: 10,0:30:54.28,0:30:55.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're morons!Dialogue: 10,0:31:04.73,0:31:06.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone's here.Dialogue: 10,0:31:08.00,0:31:12.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Someone's here"? It's gotta be Zambai and the boys!Dialogue: 10,0:31:12.71,0:31:16.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are they coming from the sea side?Dialogue: 10,0:31:16.28,0:31:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah... they usually use the upper entrance...Dialogue: 10,0:31:21.00,0:31:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe they brought Straw Hat.Dialogue: 10,0:31:23.86,0:31:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!Dialogue: 10,0:31:25.36,0:31:29.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I forgot I used you as bait to lure the Straw Hats here!Dialogue: 10,0:31:29.64,0:31:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They won't come. We're no longer friends.Dialogue: 10,0:31:33.34,0:31:34.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you that?Dialogue: 10,0:31:41.07,0:31:43.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why aren't they coming in?Dialogue: 10,0:31:44.76,0:31:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. I'm coming!Dialogue: 10,0:31:49.27,0:31:52.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay... Hey, stop already!Dialogue: 10,0:31:57.28,0:32:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, little bro... Go back to your friends.Dialogue: 10,0:32:03.65,0:32:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't do that now. I dueled my captain.Dialogue: 10,0:32:08.00,0:32:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, the ship stuff isn't settled yet, so...Dialogue: 10,0:32:12.61,0:32:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean it hasn't been settled?Dialogue: 10,0:32:15.00,0:32:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you know that your ship can't sail anymore, it's simple, ain't it?Dialogue: 10,0:32:24.23,0:32:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave her with me.Dialogue: 10,0:32:26.30,0:32:29.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of her in a way that you'll appreciate.Dialogue: 10,0:32:29.74,0:32:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all I was trying to do, you know...Dialogue: 10,0:32:31.54,0:32:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Destroying that ship for you, so you wouldn't have to.Dialogue: 10,0:32:36.55,0:32:39.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't stick your nose into it! It's my business!Dialogue: 10,0:32:39.31,0:32:43.42,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm trying to solve your problem!Dialogue: 10,0:32:40.37,0:32:42.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zambai?Dialogue: 10,0:32:43.42,0:32:44.65,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,You should be thankful!Dialogue: 10,0:32:44.65,0:32:47.84,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Thankful? Give me a break!Dialogue: 10,0:32:48.78,0:32:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?! It's a nuisance for the ship too!Dialogue: 10,0:32:53.52,0:32:58.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She loves you guys so much that she appeared in human form.Dialogue: 10,0:32:58.02,0:33:01.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If she sinks in the middle of the sea while you guys are on board...Dialogue: 10,0:33:01.96,0:33:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! If that happens, even if she dies,Dialogue: 10,0:33:05.40,0:33:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she won't be able to rest in peace!Dialogue: 10,0:33:07.85,0:33:11.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you'd just walk away from a dying friend, saying,Dialogue: 10,0:33:11.44,0:33:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Well, I hope you rest in peace"?!Dialogue: 10,0:33:15.16,0:33:18.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a whole different topic of conversation!Dialogue: 10,0:33:18.81,0:33:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As if! This is exactly that topic!Dialogue: 10,0:33:21.89,0:33:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just don't get it, do you?!Dialogue: 10,0:33:28.15,0:33:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 10,0:33:29.45,0:33:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mozu!Dialogue: 10,0:33:36.39,0:33:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiwi!Dialogue: 10,0:33:37.20,0:33:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me... for interrupting.Dialogue: 10,0:33:44.61,0:33:48.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just, these two ladies didn't let us in, so...Dialogue: 10,0:33:48.12,0:33:52.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you bastards doing here?!Dialogue: 10,0:33:55.63,0:33:56.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 10,0:33:56.31,0:33:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the hell is this?!Dialogue: 10,0:34:02.27,0:34:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno! What's the meaning of–Dialogue: 10,0:34:06.62,0:34:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this? How cocky!Dialogue: 10,0:34:10.23,0:34:13.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?!Dialogue: 10,0:34:14.12,0:34:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You do know who you're picking a fight with, right?!Dialogue: 10,0:34:20.41,0:34:23.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're just the owner of some sleazy tavern!Dialogue: 10,0:34:23.55,0:34:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with that getup?!Dialogue: 10,0:34:25.88,0:34:30.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're acting strange! What's going on?!Dialogue: 10,0:34:30.09,0:34:30.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tch.Dialogue: 10,0:34:33.10,0:34:34.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough, Blueno.Dialogue: 10,0:34:42.39,0:34:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! A-Are you okay?!Dialogue: 10,0:34:44.68,0:34:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't kill him yet. Don't forget our mission.Dialogue: 10,0:34:44.68,0:34:46.12,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!Dialogue: 10,0:34:48.39,0:34:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry.Dialogue: 10,0:34:49.11,0:34:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What's going on?! Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:34:51.85,0:34:54.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Aren't they shipwrights?Dialogue: 10,0:34:54.91,0:34:57.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell? How did he...?Dialogue: 10,0:34:57.53,0:34:59.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you people?!Dialogue: 10,0:34:59.81,0:35:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure are acting pretty super, aren't you?!Dialogue: 10,0:35:02.50,0:35:08.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt those innocent girls?! They're like my little sisters, you bastards!Dialogue: 10,0:35:08.96,0:35:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you know about this place?Dialogue: 10,0:35:11.05,0:35:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my secret base!Dialogue: 10,0:35:13.91,0:35:18.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't care about that. I'll keep this simple. Listen carefully.Dialogue: 10,0:35:18.33,0:35:21.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were undercover here.Dialogue: 10,0:35:21.49,0:35:24.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In reality, we are World Government intelligence agents.Dialogue: 10,0:35:25.48,0:35:28.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must know what that means...Dialogue: 10,0:35:28.45,0:35:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as well as the reason we came here.Dialogue: 10,0:35:31.28,0:35:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, we already know everything.Dialogue: 10,0:35:34.81,0:35:36.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam...Dialogue: 10,0:35:36.91,0:35:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's other disciple, who apparently died eight years ago,Dialogue: 10,0:35:41.96,0:35:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is you.Dialogue: 10,0:35:45.16,0:35:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you found out, but color me impressed.Dialogue: 10,0:35:49.31,0:35:52.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At the same time, that's pretty unsettling.Dialogue: 10,0:35:53.21,0:35:56.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that idiot Iceburg doing okay?Dialogue: 10,0:35:56.59,0:35:57.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We killed him.Dialogue: 10,0:36:00.14,0:36:02.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't try to play dumb now...Dialogue: 10,0:36:03.25,0:36:05.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We already know everything.Dialogue: 10,0:36:07.08,0:36:09.83,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before they come for me.Dialogue: 10,0:36:10.70,0:36:13.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Take them and leave the island, Franky.Dialogue: 10,0:36:13.82,0:36:19.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom handed them down to Iceburg... and Iceburg to you.Dialogue: 10,0:36:20.70,0:36:22.74,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Both of you, come over here.Dialogue: 10,0:36:22.74,0:36:25.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna entrust something important to you two.Dialogue: 10,0:36:25.67,0:36:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our mission took quite a while, but it's finally checkmate.Dialogue: 10,0:36:29.37,0:36:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, hand over the blueprints for the ancient weapon Pluton, Cutty Flam.Dialogue: 10,0:36:37.06,0:36:39.72,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Flam...? That's a strange name.Dialogue: 10,0:36:40.08,0:36:42.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,"Franky" would do, right? "Franky" works.Dialogue: 10,0:36:42.63,0:36:44.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything is fine.Dialogue: 10,0:36:44.17,0:36:46.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?Dialogue: 10,0:36:46.27,0:36:50.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm saying hand them over, Cutty Flam.Dialogue: 10,0:36:50.44,0:36:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing for you, you snakes!Dialogue: 10,0:36:56.19,0:36:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?!Dialogue: 10,0:37:05.41,0:37:09.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What just happened?! It was so fast I couldn't see a thing.Dialogue: 10,0:37:10.56,0:37:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 10,0:37:18.03,0:37:19.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 10,0:37:19.86,0:37:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Lucci?Dialogue: 10,0:37:21.84,0:37:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this filthy room?Dialogue: 10,0:37:24.95,0:37:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A drafting room?Dialogue: 10,0:37:26.52,0:37:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 10,0:37:28.23,0:37:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'd be a good place to hide blueprints. Find them!Dialogue: 10,0:37:42.11,0:37:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These are... nameplates?Dialogue: 10,0:37:45.37,0:37:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam.Dialogue: 10,0:37:47.27,0:37:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg.Dialogue: 10,0:37:48.66,0:37:49.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom.Dialogue: 10,0:37:49.91,0:37:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This name is...Dialogue: 10,0:37:54.37,0:37:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 10,0:37:56.84,0:37:59.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't touch anything!Dialogue: 10,0:38:01.01,0:38:05.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't just mess with people's memories!Dialogue: 10,0:38:05.72,0:38:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were raised here.Dialogue: 10,0:38:09.43,0:38:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was the shipbuilding company, Tom's Workers,Dialogue: 10,0:38:12.72,0:38:16.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,home of the world's best shipwright!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:54.01,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,KlabautermannDialogue: 1,0:01:50.17,0:01:54.01,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,KlabautermannDialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:43.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Main Bridge Opposite the Garbage Dump Northeast Shore, the Narrows, Water SevenDialogue: 1,0:10:40.58,0:10:43.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Main Bridge Opposite the Garbage Dump Northeast Shore, the Narrows, Water SevenDialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,A Warehouse Under the Bridge (Franky's Secret Base)Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,A Warehouse Under the Bridge (Franky's Secret Base)Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 2,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 2,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.